+    """An operand row format whose committed words are NOT the sponge's lane elements (``fp4/hashed.py`` ``FP4Format``:
+    64 E2M1 codes + 4 UE4M3 scale bytes per column -> 72 nibbles).  Per column, the ``k`` words map to ``n_elems``
